flowchart TD
    Request[受保护请求] --> Identity{身份有效}
    Identity -->|否| NoLogin[401 身份无效]
    Identity -->|是| Role{角色有资格}
    Role -->|否| Forbidden[403 权限不足]
    Role -->|是| Scope{对象在范围内}
    Scope -->|否| Forbidden
    Scope -->|是| Business{业务条件满足}
    Business -->|否| Rejected["400 / 404 / 409<br/>按合同拒绝"]
    Business -->|是| Execute[执行并返回服务端事实]
